              "_title": "Índice Completo de Crónicas Audiovisuales y Videoteca",
              "html": "<style>\n.lastras-hemeroteca-index {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1240px;\n  margin: 2.2rem auto 1.2rem auto;\n  background: #FFFFFF;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(17, 24, 21, 0.12);\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(17, 24, 21, 0.04);\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-index summary {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;\n  font-size: 1.28rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #111815;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 1rem;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-index summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n  display: none;\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-badge {\n  font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.76rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  background: rgba(184, 74, 40, 0.12);\n  color: #B84A28;\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-list {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 0.65rem 1.4rem;\n  margin-top: 1.25rem;\n  padding-top: 1.25rem;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(17, 24, 21, 0.08);\n  list-style: none;\n  padding-left: 0;\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-list li {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-list a {\n  color: #1E293B !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  display: inline-block;\n  transition: color 0.18s ease;\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-list a:hover {\n  color: #B84A28 !important;\n  text-decoration: underline !important;\n}\n.lastras-hemeroteca-date {\n  color: #64748B;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  margin-right: 5px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n@media (max-width: 960px) {\n  .lastras-hemeroteca-list {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .lastras-hemeroteca-index {\n    padding: 1.15rem 1.15rem;\n  }\n  .lastras-hemeroteca-index summary {\n    font-size: 1.08rem;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .lastras-hemeroteca-list {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n<details class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-index\">\n  <summary>\n    <span>📚 Índice Completo de Crónicas Audiovisuales y Videoteca</span>\n    <span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-badge\">Archivo de Vídeo (10 artículos) ▾</span>\n  </summary>\n  <ul class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-list\">\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2020]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/lastras-sin-coronavirus/\">Lastras sin coronavirus</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2018]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/segovia-de-pueblo-en-pueblo-lastras-de-cuellar/\">Segovia de pueblo en pueblo, Lastras de Cuéllar</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2017]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/informativo-lastras-cuellar/\">Informativo de Lastras de Cuéllar</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2017]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/seguimiento-del-proyecto-restauracion-la-laguna-lastras-cuellar-hontalbilla/\">Seguimiento del Proyecto de restauración de las Lagunas de Lastras de Cuéllar y Hontalbilla</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2015]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/un-ano-sin-agua/\">Un año sin agua</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2013]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/vientos-y-arenas/\">Vientos y arenas</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2012]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/aunque-duermas-parte-2/\">Aunque duermas parte 2</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2011]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/a-pescar-el-lomo/\">A pescar el lomo</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[2011]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/aunque-duermas/\">Aunque duermas primera parte 1</a></li>\n    <li><span class=\"lastras-hemeroteca-date\">[1978]</span><a href=\"https://www.lastrasdecuellar.net/lastras-cuellar-1978/\">Lastras de Cuéllar 1978</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</details>"
